---
// Decorative: the palette filters three hits down to the one the query is about.
---
<div class="ill ill--search" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="ill__panel ill__palette">
    <div class="ill__field">
      <span class="ill__dot"></span>
      <span>серв</span>
      <span class="ill__mono" style="margin-left:auto">esc</span>
    </div>

    <div class="ill__hits">
      <div class="ill__hit">
        <b>Сервис: позвонить</b>
        <span class="ill__mono">карьера · сегодня</span>
      </div>
      <div class="ill__hit">
        <b>Сервисный центр</b>
        <span class="ill__mono">проекты · 12 ноя</span>
      </div>
      <div class="ill__hit">
        <b>Домашний сервер</b>
        <span class="ill__mono">база знаний · 4 ноя</span>
      </div>
      <div class="ill__hit">
        <b>Сервисный аккаунт</b>
        <span class="ill__mono">личное · 2 ноя</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ill__foot ill__mono">
      <span>↑↓ выбрать</span>
      <span>esc</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
